note S4: write and read on unsized arrays inside the count: prints ABC and a newline (exit 0).
om2
fn g v view uchar * to void
w = write 1 v 0 len v
end
fn h e edit uchar * to void
for i ulong len e
put e i add uchar i 65
end
put e sub len e 1 10
g e
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 4 0
h a
ret 0
end
